---
layout: layouts/base.njk
legacyShell: true
title: "Rashid — Full-Stack Developer & AI Engineer"
metaDescription: "Rashid (MOT1209) — full-stack developer and AI engineer in Germany, and the maker behind King Studio. Web platforms, AI tools and browser games, available for freelance projects and full-time roles."
ogDescription: "Web platforms, AI tools and browser games — and King Studio, where the games and apps live."
metaKeywords: "Rashid, MOT1209, Full-Stack Developer, AI Engineer, King Studio, JavaScript, Three.js, Supabase, Portfolio"
canonical: "https://rashid-wep.vercel.app/"
activeNav: home
noAds: true
showSettings: true
headExtra: "partials/home/head-extra.njk"
extraBodyScript: "partials/home/body-script.njk"
---
{%- set work = kingStudio.featured.games.concat(kingStudio.featured.apps) %}
<section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">Rashid · MOT1209 · Germany</span>
        <h1 id="home-title" class="home-title">I build web apps, browser games and AI tools — and ship them.</h1>
        <p class="home-lede">Full-stack developer and AI engineer. My games and apps live under <a href="king-studio/">King Studio</a>: {{ kingStudio.projects | length }} projects, {{ releases.items | length }} of them with Android builds.</p>
        <p class="home-availability"><span class="home-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Available for freelance projects and full-time roles</p>
        <div class="home-actions">
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Work with me</a>
            <a href="king-studio/" class="btn btn-secondary">Explore King Studio</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="projects" class="home-section ks" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="home-section-head">
            <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">Selected work</span>
                <h2 id="work-title">Games and apps you can use today</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="home-more" href="king-studio/">All projects in King Studio<span aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
        <ul class="ks-grid">
{%- set root = "" %}
{%- for project in work %}
{% include "king-studio/card.njk" %}
{%- endfor %}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="services" class="home-section home-section-alt" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="home-section-head">
            <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">What I do</span>
                <h2 id="services-title">Where I can help</h2>
            </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="home-services">
            <li class="card">
                <h3>Web platforms</h3>
                <p>Fast static and full-stack sites with Eleventy, Supabase and serverless functions, like this one.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="card">
                <h3>AI integration</h3>
                <p>Assistants and automations on Gemini and OpenRouter, from a prototype to something people use.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="card">
                <h3>Browser and mobile games</h3>
                <p>Three.js games shipped as installable PWAs and as Android apps built with Capacitor.</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="home-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="wrap home-about">
        <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
            <h2 id="about-title">Built in the open</h2>
            <p>I'm Rashid. It started with changing CSS to see what broke and breaking JavaScript to see why. It turned into shipping real software: browser games on custom Three.js engines, offline-capable apps people install on their phones, and AI tools wired into Gemini.</p>
            <p>The source for most of it is on <a href="https://github.com/MOT1209" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p>
            <ul class="home-stack" aria-label="Tools I use">
                <li class="tag">JavaScript</li>
                <li class="tag">Python</li>
                <li class="tag">Node.js</li>
                <li class="tag">Three.js</li>
                <li class="tag">Supabase</li>
                <li class="tag">Eleventy</li>
                <li class="tag">Capacitor</li>
                <li class="tag">Vercel</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="home-more" href="about.html">More about me<span aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
        <dl class="home-facts">
            <div><dt>Projects in King Studio</dt><dd>{{ kingStudio.projects | length }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Android builds</dt><dd>{{ releases.items | length }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Latest release</dt><dd>{{ releases.updatedAt }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Germany</dd></div>
        </dl>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="writing" class="home-section home-section-alt" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="home-section-head">
            <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">Writing</span>
                <h2 id="writing-title">Latest from the blog</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="home-more" href="blog/">All posts<span aria-hidden="true"> &rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
        <ul class="home-posts">
{%- for post in blogPosts.slice(0, 3) %}
            <li class="card">
                <p class="home-post-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date }}">{{ post.date }}</time> · {{ post.readTime }} min read</p>
                <h3><a href="blog/{{ post.id }}.html">{{ post.title }}</a></h3>
                <p>{{ post.description }}</p>
            </li>
{%- endfor %}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="home-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="home-section-head">
            <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
                <h2 id="contact-title">Get in touch</h2>
                <p class="home-section-note">A freelance project, a full-time role, a collaboration, or a bug in something I built: all welcome.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="home-channels">
            <li><a href="mailto:zwnt45602@gmail.com" class="card home-channel"><i class="fas fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Email</span><small>zwnt45602@gmail.com</small></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/MOT1209" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card home-channel"><i class="fab fa-github" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>GitHub</span><small>@MOT1209</small></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://youtube.com/@مختبرالبرمجه" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card home-channel"><i class="fab fa-youtube" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>YouTube</span><small dir="auto">مختبر البرمجه</small></a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@programmierlabor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="card home-channel"><i class="fab fa-tiktok" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>TikTok</span><small>@programmierlabor</small></a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="home-actions">
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary">Send a message</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="settings-overlay" id="settings-overlay"></div>
<div class="settings-modal" id="settings-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="settings-title">
    <div class="settings-header">
        <h2 id="settings-title">Settings</h2>
        <button type="button" class="icon-button" id="close-settings" aria-label="Close settings"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg></button>
    </div>
    <div class="settings-group">
        <h3>Theme</h3>
        <div class="settings-options">
            <button type="button" class="settings-opt" data-theme-opt="light" aria-pressed="false">Light</button>
            <button type="button" class="settings-opt" data-theme-opt="dark" aria-pressed="false">Dark</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="settings-group">
        <h3>Accent</h3>
        <div class="settings-options">
{%- for accent in [["#c2410c", "Ember"], ["#1d4ed8", "Ink blue"], ["#15803d", "Pine"], ["#7e22ce", "Violet"], ["#b91c1c", "Brick"], ["#0f766e", "Teal"]] %}
            <button type="button" class="accent-dot" data-color="{{ accent[0] }}" style="--dot: {{ accent[0] }}" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{{ accent[1] }} accent"></button>
{%- endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="settings-group">
        <label class="settings-toggle">
            <span>Reduce motion</span>
            <input type="checkbox" id="reduce-motion">
        </label>
    </div>
</div>
